summary:
  A station the heal moved to a new address loses its reading at the moment
  the list is rewritten.

history:
  The move is written while the station plays. Without the old address's
  number it would swell to full level there, by up to fifteen decibels, and
  come down again half a minute later.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
          if (!rows[i] || rows[i].hostname !== url || typeof rows[i].prev !== "string") continue;

replace:
          if (!rows[i] || rows[i].hostname !== url || typeof rows[i].prev !== "number") continue;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_a_station_that_moved_keeps_its_reading_until_it_has_a_new_one.
  Line-neutral.
